## EmailJS Configuration Example

# Dobij od https://www.emailjs.com → Account → API Keys
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here

# Dobij od https://www.emailjs.com → Email Services
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=service_xxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Dobij od https://www.emailjs.com → Email Templates → Customer Template
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID_CUSTOMER=template_xxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Dobij od https://www.emailjs.com → Email Templates → Owner Template  
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID_OWNER=template_xxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Napomena: 
# - Kreiraj `.env.local` sa pravim vrednostima za development
# - Nikada ne pushuj `.env.local` na Git!
# - Za Vercel, dodaj te vrednosti u Environment Variables
